{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act28side_level_act28side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act28side",
  "stageId": "act28side_02",
  "title": "雙重保險",
  "storyCode": "CV-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d8403ad26bbb7d0502c6fadc6c0fabec344b4a137ae66d2c3b054060b4977282",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "我一定是出現幻覺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "怎麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "按照排查的結果，能源塔裡幾乎沒一處完好無損的地方，全是故障和破損，還丟了一大堆東西，按理說早該塌了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼技術員",
      "text": "我這邊也是，備用零件幾乎全沒了，連傳送帶都被拆了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "唉……商隊大概隔兩個月會來一次達維鎮，用生活必需品和我們換東西，主要是沒啥用的工業設備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "哼，他們那是換？他們那是明搶！看到這輛堆高機了嗎？買來之後基本沒怎麼用過，八成新的堆高機！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "你猜那幫所謂的商隊想用什麼東西換它？十箱罐頭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "大家總歸是要吃飯的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "……看來這座動力爐在發生事故之前就已經處於嚴重的失修狀態了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "原來操持這工作的爐工是有很多的。現在就剩下邁爾斯一個人，能保證運轉就不錯了，總不能把他一個人抵十個用吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "別說了，我現在恨不得把自己一個當成一百個來用……這工作根本沒有任務單上說的那麼輕鬆，弄不好要修到年後去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "別啊，我還指望一週修好拿二十萬呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "二十萬算什麼，要是能在特里蒙投資大佬身邊做保全，可不止二十萬呢……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "等大佬被我伺候開心了，大手一揮，給我兩個億，還會溫柔地對我說：啊，這點投資你拿去，別客氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "嘖，兩個億……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "那麼多錢，整個達維鎮都能重新修一遍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "唉，也就是過過嘴癮，我在黑鋼的那點案子哪裡花得了兩個億……根本不夠格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "你這小姑娘，別做白日夢了，趕緊幹活吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼技術員",
      "text": "老爺子，你不知道，聽著羅拉小姐絮絮叨叨我們才安心，她做事時腦袋轉得飛快，全靠講廢話散熱，要是她突然不說話了，說明……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "…………",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "………………",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "呃，說明什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼技術員",
      "text": "……說明問題太大，她腦袋已經轉當機了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "（吞嚥口水）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "……各隊聽我指示，迅速停下手中工作，沿原路退出能源塔，快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "動作快！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的銀行員工",
      "text": "西爾維婭，帳目流水能在今晚九點前處理好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "沒、沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的銀行員工",
      "text": "那我就不管了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "好……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的銀行員工",
      "text": "啊哈……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的銀行員工",
      "text": "唉，經理和那兩個人聊多久了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "……帳款……情況不甚樂觀……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……這不是……擅作決斷……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "等等，雷蛇，什麼動靜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "停電……能源塔？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "抱歉，情況緊急，我們需要立刻去確認情況，之後再向各位解釋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "沒關係，請。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷淡的銀行員工",
      "text": "唉，看來備用電力系統開啟了，我還想說停電就能下班呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的銀行員工",
      "text": "著急什麼，下了班也沒有事情做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的銀行員工",
      "text": "我快受不了這個鬼地方了，沒有酒吧，沒有夜店，就只有一家小餐廳在供應能吃的東西，現在連半死不活的能源塔也壞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的銀行員工",
      "text": "喂，西爾維婭，為什麼你的鎮長老媽在任的時候不多開幾家餐廳啊，她味覺失靈嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的銀行員工",
      "text": "西爾維婭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷淡的銀行員工",
      "text": "呵，難道是趁停電溜了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "這是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "地塊……怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "羅拉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "喂，羅拉，能聽見嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "羅拉？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "伍德洛先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "地塊上出什麼事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "我……我不知道，但情況看起來不容樂觀，我正要趕回去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "帶我一程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "……好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "潔西卡，你在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "雷蛇隊長？我正在往地塊中心趕！羅拉一直聯繫不上，地塊上發生什麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我們剛剛和羅拉取得了極短時間的聯繫，但訊號極差，只能確認修理能源塔的過程中出現了突發狀況，不過她本人暫時沒有危險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "可……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "別慌，保證自己安全，到海倫娜的餐廳集合，明白嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "……明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "你還能開得更快一點嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "抱歉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "我叫你開快點，不是讓你急得哭出來。你的隊長剛才說了，那位羅拉小姐沒危險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "只是暫時沒有危險，能源塔顯然出了大問題，要是她沒能及時撤出……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "假如她真有事，你去了又能怎樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "我不知道……但我必須回去。她是我的同伴，如果這時我不在她身邊，那還能有誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "（小聲）呵，同伴……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "達維鎮的道路又破爛又崎嶇，你還是先小心開車吧，前面有個急轉彎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "多謝，老闆娘，多謝您願意讓我們在這裡等人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "沒什麼，反正供暖和電力都停了，應急燈幾個人點都是點，你們在這，餐廳也能暖和一點，想要什麼儘管和我說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "窗外那是……我們的小隊成員嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "羅拉呢？還有其他人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "text": "呼……呼……還在能源塔裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "到底出了什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "text": "羅拉小姐突然叫停了修繕，讓所有人退出能源塔……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "text": "從塔裡出來後，她要求隊裡所有的感染者留下，其他人，包括里昂先生和邁爾斯先生，迅速離開，越遠越好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "text": "然後……她帶著那些人重新進去了，還說如果到八點鐘她還沒出來，就立刻疏散地塊上的居民。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "能確認出了什麼狀況嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "text": "她……沒說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "能再次聯繫上羅拉嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "text": "也……不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "那其他人呢？我們有半個小隊在裡面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我受夠了，我現在就過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "坐下，芙蘭卡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "隊長，你該比我清楚，就算裡面發生爆炸，也不可能把所有人的通訊裝置一口氣全震壞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "一個都聯繫不上，說明裡面很可能出現了大規模的活性源石擴散，所有人的通訊系統都受到了強烈干擾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "這絕對是緊急事態，雷蛇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你現在趕去能源塔能做什麼呢？別忘了羅拉說的，要是到八點她那邊還沒動靜，我們需要準備整個地塊的疏散事宜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "如果聽你的，真出事的話，地塊上的居民誰來疏散？銀行車庫裡的政府人員嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "那你就這麼乾等著，讓羅拉他們自求多福？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "別因為擔心失去了判斷力，芙蘭卡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我很抱歉，但您能不能告訴我，現在幾點了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "下午五點五十七。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "羅拉——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "啊……是你啊，西爾維婭小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "發、發生什麼了？你們看起來很……緊張……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "動力爐搶修過程中發生了意外，但實際情況仍然不明，我們也在等待結果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "怪不得會停電……如果、如果我能幫得上忙……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "哼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "里昂先生，你去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "餐廳裡太悶，我出去走走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "西爾維婭小姐，我很讚賞你的勇氣，但現在我們能做的只有安心等待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "……雷蛇小姐，那個，我的媽媽……是這裡上上一任鎮長，她為這裡操勞一生……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "只是媽媽生病了……我必須得有份工作，所以才去了銀行……不是想背叛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "請您相信，我是真的希望能幫到你們，不管里昂先生對你們說了什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你好像搞錯了，里昂先生什麼也沒和我說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "……是、是嗎？抱歉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "如果你也擔心能源塔，可以在這裡和我們坐一下，等等消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "不……我想還是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "好，我和你們一起等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "如果大家覺得沒有問題，那到時候就照這份計劃執行疏散吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "辛苦大家了，暫時先休息休息吧，我和芙蘭卡繼續守著就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "唉……現在幾點了，雷蛇隊長？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "七點整。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……只剩一個小時了，隊長。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我們……真的要等到八點鐘嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "報……報告！潔西卡歸隊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "羅拉怎麼樣了？我們什麼時候去支援她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "如果你問我們什麼時候從這裡離開，答案是八點鐘，如果你問我們什麼時候去支援羅拉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我現在沒心情和那邊那個瓦伊凡吵架，你直接去問她吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "疏散？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "只有不到一個小時了，你們真的打算就坐在這裡乾等？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "先生，您是哪位？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "這位是伍德洛先生，地塊上的……獵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你們認識？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "潔西卡小姐在地塊外迷路的時候，是我將她帶到了達維鎮。剛剛她送了我一程，把我帶到了這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……感謝您對潔西卡的幫助，伍德洛先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "如果能源塔真出了問題，你們為什麼還坐在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我們相信自己的同事可以處理好這次危機，他們是應對源石污染的專業人員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "是嗎？你那位副手可沒有你沉得住氣啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "伍德洛先生，如果事故真的發生，我們需要立即疏散居民，只能留在這裡以備不時之需。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "感謝你們願意把消息跟外人分享。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "不過我不是你們的同事，你們不去，那我自己去看看情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "這可能很危險——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "多謝提醒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "等等，伍德洛先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "怎麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "……我也去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "潔西卡？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "別那麼衝動……潔西卡，至少你也該相信羅拉，你就算去了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "我知道，就算我去了，也做不了什麼……但羅拉她就在裡面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "如果羅拉能安全出來，我就能第一時間迎接她，給她一個擁抱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "如果她真的出了什麼事……我至少還有衝進去的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "那就一起走吧，小姑娘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "……？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "羅……羅拉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "讓開啦，潔西卡……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "我快要餓死了，不要擋著餐館的門啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "報……報告雷蛇隊長，羅拉帶著剩餘的全部成員……安全歸隊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "謝天謝地，你真的回來了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "羅拉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "呃……總、總之就是爆炸導致動力爐管道堆積的大量的源石沉降物處於臨界狀態一不小心就可能被活化……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "為了安全起見我讓大家先走我們盡了最大努力發現無論採取何種方案那片沉降物都有活化可能性而且不低……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "羅拉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "隊長別問了再問我也不可能這麼快修好但是我還是想到辦法保住了動力爐最基本的供暖功能至少大家暫時都不會受凍了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "至於地塊是否能夠重新行進我們只能——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "羅拉，夠了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "隊長……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "我真的、真的只能做到這些了……不好意思……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "不，我是說你能帶著大家安全回來就夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "是嗎……那就好……其實……我肚子真的很餓……好餓好餓……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "那我們就先吃飯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "把肚子填飽，然後好好睡一覺……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
